  "description": "Set five cones in two staggered rows: three near the boards and two inside the face-off circle. Skaters line up in the corner. One at a time, wrap around each cone in turn, like a worm wiggling down the ice. After the last cone, the coach passes a puck; skate in and shoot. The next skater goes when the one ahead reaches the third cone.",
